{
  "name": "@vscar/web",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "VScar Web (Step 7a): Next.js App Router production base. Language × market routing (/es-es, /en-es), server-first decision, lazy client pipeline, robustness in a Web Worker. Uses the pure engines over a controlled Dataset Core snapshot (no DB, no public API).",
